<title>SWEDEN: Swedish June trade surplus rose to 13.6 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish June trade surplus rose to 13.6 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's June trade surplus</p>
<p>was 13.6 billion crowns, up 2.2 billion crowns from May,</p>
<p>Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     June 97    May 97   June 96</p>
<p> Exports			 54.3	 50.7	 48.5</p>
<p> Imports			 40.7	 39.3	 34.9</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +13.6     +11.4	+13.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 12.8 billion crown surplus.</p>
</text>
